 releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest a white triangle sits at its base scale on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magenta artboard."}],"type":"topic"}}}